      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EBONY EYES (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (16.12) at this track behind Little Snitch in a Maiden. Has the early speed to give a sight. The form out of last race has been strong. Key chance in this line up. RIPPER MULWEE (5) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing seventh (18.13) at Taree Super Track latest. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. CLASSY LEXIE (1) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Botulinum (17.99) in a Maiden. Was in the money the start prior. Better than last start and can bounce back. BIG RED ACES (3) is a newcomer from the Craig Blakemore kennel. Can feature with the right run.",
